sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant W as Web
    participant A as API
    participant D as DB

    U->>W: submit form
    W->>A: POST /orders
    activate A
    A->>D: INSERT order
    D-->>A: id
    A-->>W: 201 Created
    deactivate A
    W-->>U: confirmation

    Note over A,D: wrapped in a transaction
